//! The pass tracer's Rust dumper against the Java one: `data/trace/GenTraceVectors.java` builds
//! statement trees with the real Vineflower 1.12.0 classes and dumps them with
//! `tools/vftrace/src/kuna/vftrace/Dumper.java` (`data/trace/vectors.txt`, regenerated by
//! `data/trace/gen.sh`). Each builder below mirrors the Java one statement by statement, so the
//! statement ids drawn from the counters line up.

